{"id":"colors-en-css","title":"Colors en CSS","topic":"css","topicLabel":"CSS","tags":["aprendizaje","css"],"course":null,"headings":[{"depth":2,"text":"¿Qué es?","id":"que-es"},{"depth":2,"text":"¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)","id":"como-se-escribe-sintaxis"}],"readingMins":1,"codeBlocks":0.5,"words":64,"backlinks":[{"id":"sesion-07-18-05-26","title":"Sesion_07_18.05.26","topicLabel":"HTML","session":7}],"html":"<h2 id=\"que-es\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Qué es?</h2><p>Pots definir colors de diverses formes: pel seu <strong>nom</strong> en anglès (red, blue), per codi <strong>hexadecimal</strong> (molt usat en disseny) o per <strong>RGB</strong> (barreja de vermell, verd i blau). També existeix <strong>RGBA</strong>, on la &quot;A&quot; permet afegir transparència .</p>\n<h2 id=\"como-se-escribe-sintaxis\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)</h2><div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">css</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">body</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">color</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">#222222</span>; <span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* Hexadecimal */</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">background-color</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">rgba</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">255</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">0.5</span>); <span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* Vermell amb transparència */</span>\n}</code></pre></div>"}